Example: In the ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/untyped-calculus-of-booleans-and-numbers.td")}, the followings are nonsensical:

- $\text{succ}\ \text{tru}$
- $\text{if}\ 1\ \text{then}\ ...$
